Attribution
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This work is an adaptation of "Carry That Weight" by MrPMG
https://www.nexusmods.com/skyrimspecialedition/mods/50144
released by its author under CC BY-SA 4.0.

Changes made to the original work:

- New plugins that use the original plugin (CarryThatWeight_MrPMG.esp) as a
  master and override some of its records.
- New Papyrus scripts written for this project.
- A recompiled copy of the original MCM script (__pmg_CapacityTools_MCM), with
  an added handler that reads the current settings when the menu opens.

The original work is available, free of charge, at the address above.
